  "kv23.3:9.2": "āmantā. ",
  "kv23.3:9.3": "bodhisatto issariyakāmakārikāhetu aññaṃ satthāraṃ uddisīti ",
  "kv23.3:9.4": "attheva suttantoti. ",
  "kv23.3:9.5": "natthi. ",
  "kv23.3:9.6": "hañci bodhisatto issariyakāmakārikāhetu aññaṃ satthāraṃ uddisīti ",
  "kv23.3:9.7": "nattheva suttanto no vata re vattabbe ",
  "kv23.3:9.8": "bodhisatto issariyakāmakārikāhetu aññaṃ satthāraṃ uddisīti. ",
